If we ever don't like what you're doing...

00:21:37.200 --> 00:21:41.410
We'll... We'll leave whenever we want!

00:21:41.410 --> 00:21:42.480
Have it your way.

00:21:56.880 --> 00:21:58.540
Ahead at half speed.

00:21:58.540 --> 00:22:01.080
Ahead at half speed.

